{"_type":"issue","id":"shop-wv3.2.2","title":"Handle the payment webhook","description":"The provider calls us when a payment settles. Verify the signature, then mark the order paid once, even when the provider retries.\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Provider\n    participant Webhook\n    participant Orders\n    Provider-\u003e\u003eWebhook: payment.settled\n    Webhook-\u003e\u003eWebhook: verify signature\n    Webhook-\u003e\u003eOrders: mark paid (idempotent)\n    Orders--\u003e\u003eWebhook: ok\n    Webhook--\u003e\u003eProvider: 200\n```","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"alex","owner":"sam@example.com","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:05Z","created_by":"sam","updated_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:47Z","started_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:47Z","labels":["backend","checkout","payments"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"shop-wv3.2.2","depends_on_id":"shop-wv3.2","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:05Z","created_by":"sam","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"shop-wv3.2.2","depends_on_id":"shop-wv3.2.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:40Z","created_by":"sam","metadata":"{}"}],"comments":[{"id":"82ef0405-ea5c-5fc6-8100-a2a8362dd275","issue_id":"shop-wv3.2.2","author":"alex","text":"The provider retries for 24 hours, so the handler must accept the same event twice.","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:07:51Z"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":2,"comment_count":1}
